# Zone 1 room 03's main pit with no far side, for tools/replay/gap_reach.gd (--room=test/longpit
# --edge=576 --ledge=672): the same hall floor (672 u), ceiling (the upper level's floor, 288 u
# over the hall floor) and spike line (128 u under the floor for 8 tiles, then 64 u, and 32 u for
# the 4 tiles before the far wall, tiles 92 to 95) as
# content/rooms/zone1/03_pogo_chain.room, running on to the room's end so that the measured reach
# is the farthest any route goes, not where a far wall stops it.
room test/longpit
size 150 28
spawn 300 672
tiles
